 "centre_position_note": "Moved 16 November 2026 from 52.90194, -0.58734 (the NG31 7TX postcode point, at the A52 / B6403 junction at Cold Harbour) to the Spitalgate Airfield site (the former Prince William of Gloucester Barracks), on its road 150 m in from its way out on to Somerby Hill (the A52, OSM ways 183635688 out and 183635670 in). Which entrance the centre uses is to be confirmed.",
 "owner_check": {
  "date": "2026-11-16",
  "by": "owner",
  "note": "The owner confirmed the centre is at Spitalgate Airfield, Blue Harbour, NG31 7TX, off the B1174 near the A52 Somerby Hill / Cold Harbour area. On OpenStreetMap the airfield site's mapped ways in all join the A52 Somerby Hill; no B1174 runs by it (the B1174 is South Parade and London Road, 1.5 km west), so the site's main way in off Somerby Hill was used. Blue Harbour is not on the map (probably a new road on the airfield development).",
  "way_in": "Confirmed by the owner (2026-11-16): the old main gate off the A52 Somerby Hill (OSM ways 183635670 in, 183635688 out)."
 },
 "address": "Grantham (Somerby), Spitalgate Airfield, Blue Harbour, Grantham, Lincolnshire NG31 7TX",
 "address_checked": "2026-11-15",
 "address_note": "gov.uk live centre-finder page could not be read automatically; gov.uk impact assessment (2014) confirms the move to the former goods vehicle testing station, and an instructor page gives the NG31 7TX address. Reverse geocode of the given position lands in NG31 7TX (Cold Harbour/Old Somerby): matches.",
